# Optional: the page asks for these keys on first run and saves them in
# ~/Library/Application Support/Tattle/credentials.json.
# Keys set here win over the saved ones. Copy to .env (chmod 600); never commit it.
# TYPESAFE_API_KEY: Jev fact-checking and labels. Create one at https://console.typesafe.ai/keys
# OPENAI_API_KEY: Chat, label drafting, fact-check research, and OpenAI transcription.
# OPENAI_BASE_URL overrides the OpenAI base (default https://api.openai.com/v1).
# S2_MODEL overrides the fact-check research model id. S2_WEB=off disables research web search; S2_WEB=responses forces it.
TYPESAFE_API_KEY=
OPENAI_API_KEY=
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
